(2051971, 281186, 13077, '<td valign="top">If you can, try stopping down the aperture a little more. It''ll give you starburst effects on any fixed lights that might be in the scene, and let you use a little longer shutter speed.<br/>Also if possible, try manually focusing on a part of the scene, or it''ll have to hunt, and probably decide on one that isn''t correct. That being said, I like the lines - busses and trucks look so cool in these photos.</td>', 'If you can, try stopping down the aperture a little more. It''ll give you starburst effects on any fixed lights that might be in the scene, and let you use a little longer shutter speed.Also if possible, try manually focusing on a part of the scene, or it''ll have to hunt, and probably decide on one that isn''t correct. That being said, I like the lines - busses and trucks look so cool in these photos.', '2006-01-18 01:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2051998, 282583, 25952, '<td valign="top">seems to lack a subject, or it is too scattered for me. Perhaps a different composition would yeild a better photo of  a ''scene''</td>', 'seems to lack a subject, or it is too scattered for me. Perhaps a different composition would yeild a better photo of  a ''scene''', '2006-01-18 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052003, 282993, 13077, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. GREAT capture with the 3, 4 and 5 in the foreground. I think it represents an interstate very well, all the numbers and lights everywhere. And I like the repeating patterns of the bridge, and the fog in the background. Really hope this does well in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this shot. GREAT capture with the 3, 4 and 5 in the foreground. I think it represents an interstate very well, all the numbers and lights everywhere. And I like the repeating patterns of the bridge, and the fog in the background. Really hope this does well in the challenge.', '2006-01-18 01:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052015, 282577, 25952, '<td valign="top">should have taken a tripod to lyons road west at 1am. this doesnt do anything for me sorry.</td>', 'should have taken a tripod to lyons road west at 1am. this doesnt do anything for me sorry.', '2006-01-18 01:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052020, 282938, 25952, '<td valign="top">nice colors and composition, the blue pops against the orange tones.</td>', 'nice colors and composition, the blue pops against the orange tones.', '2006-01-18 01:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052055, 282635, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. The road is a little bright for my taste, but the skyline is exposed well. I might have cropped out the side of that building on the left, and maybe a little from the top or bottom.</td>', 'Nice perspective. The road is a little bright for my taste, but the skyline is exposed well. I might have cropped out the side of that building on the left, and maybe a little from the top or bottom.', '2006-01-18 01:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052126, 280350, 18157, '<td valign="top">I have racked my brains trying to come up with the association between this picture and road. I just can''t do it. Sorry. Hopefully I''ll be able to read what it is when this competition is over. It''s a very nice picture though.</td>', 'I have racked my brains trying to come up with the association between this picture and road. I just can''t do it. Sorry. Hopefully I''ll be able to read what it is when this competition is over. It''s a very nice picture though.', '2006-01-18 01:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052221, 281719, 41574, '<td valign="top">Come on, now: admitted, this challenge had no specific "details" to follow, but this is just a stretch beyond a stretch. This is a portrait shot of a woman that you "liked so much that you just had to submnit it." Sorry, but the title isn''t enough to qualify this image as one relating to "road." It''s a good picture, but it''s completely insolent towards the demand of the challenge.</td>', 'Come on, now: admitted, this challenge had no specific "details" to follow, but this is just a stretch beyond a stretch. This is a portrait shot of a woman that you "liked so much that you just had to submnit it." Sorry, but the title isn''t enough to qualify this image as one relating to "road." It''s a good picture, but it''s completely insolent towards the demand of the challenge.', '2006-01-18 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052240, 280555, 45000, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh....infrared.  I like it.  I love the blue cast that you put on the whole thing...  This is different than most of the IR work that I''ve seen.  What camera were you using for this photo?</td>', 'Ohhhh....infrared.  I like it.  I love the blue cast that you put on the whole thing...  This is different than most of the IR work that I''ve seen.  What camera were you using for this photo?', '2006-01-18 01:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052243, 280555, 49007, '<td valign="top">Nice infrared.</td>', 'Nice infrared.', '2006-01-18 01:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052266, 282340, 45000, '<td valign="top">Freaking amazing...  This will be on the front page for sure.  I''m going to take a wild guess and say this is Coley?  Either way...I love this picture. 10</td>', 'Freaking amazing...  This will be on the front page for sure.  I''m going to take a wild guess and say this is Coley?  Either way...I love this picture. 10', '2006-01-18 02:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052269, 280028, 45000, '<td valign="top">This looks too good to be real.  If it is though...I am amazed.  Pretty freaking good...I would love to take a Porshe on that road.  10 from me...</td>', 'This looks too good to be real.  If it is though...I am amazed.  Pretty freaking good...I would love to take a Porshe on that road.  10 from me...', '2006-01-18 02:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
