(2052284, 282185, 49007, '<td valign="top">The camera tilt diminishes the senses of how steep the road is. I think that was a mistake. It would be an amazing shot straight on.</td>', 'The camera tilt diminishes the senses of how steep the road is. I think that was a mistake. It would be an amazing shot straight on.', '2006-01-18 02:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
