(2052296, 280482, 41574, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very good shot, with a very good title. That said, the technical aspects are a bit weak: the focus isn''t quite right, there seems to be a bit of camera-shake, and a weak fill-flash might have helped bring the subject out. Nevertheless, it''s a good picture. I''d like to give it a "6.5," but shall have to settle for a...oh, what the hell: "7" it is.</td>', 'This is actually a very good shot, with a very good title. That said, the technical aspects are a bit weak: the focus isn''t quite right, there seems to be a bit of camera-shake, and a weak fill-flash might have helped bring the subject out. Nevertheless, it''s a good picture. I''d like to give it a "6.5," but shall have to settle for a...oh, what the hell: "7" it is.', '2006-01-18 02:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2052301, 281473, 49007, '<td valign="top">Focus please.</td>', 'Focus please.', '2006-01-18 02:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
