(2055498, 282616, 16488, '<td valign="top">Love the shapes in this image the snaky road and the rounded cactus. The colors are warm and oddly inviting to this hostile desert environment. The late-day light makes me strain to appreciate the textures and I just wish, for that reason, it were a bit brighter.</td>', 'Love the shapes in this image the snaky road and the rounded cactus. The colors are warm and oddly inviting to this hostile desert environment. The late-day light makes me strain to appreciate the textures and I just wish, for that reason, it were a bit brighter.', '2006-01-18 18:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
