(2056184, 282655, 49480, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...I really like the selective desat and this is a very clever interpretation of the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'Very pretty...I really like the selective desat and this is a very clever interpretation of the challenge.  Good job.', '2006-01-18 21:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056189, 280691, 49480, '<td valign="top">My God that''s beautiful...where was this taken?  The streaking lights of the cars really adds a nice effect to this shot.  Great picture!</td>', 'My God that''s beautiful...where was this taken?  The streaking lights of the cars really adds a nice effect to this shot.  Great picture!', '2006-01-18 21:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056195, 282272, 49480, '<td valign="top">Beautiful misty road.  The composition on this shot is very good.  I especially like the curves leading in from the edges of the bottom of the shot on both sides.  The line of trees is really cool how they gradually become more and more concealed by the fog.  Very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful misty road.  The composition on this shot is very good.  I especially like the curves leading in from the edges of the bottom of the shot on both sides.  The line of trees is really cool how they gradually become more and more concealed by the fog.  Very nice!', '2006-01-18 21:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056198, 281786, 49480, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  The colors in this picture and the OOF background are great.  I really like this.</td>', 'Very creative.  The colors in this picture and the OOF background are great.  I really like this.', '2006-01-18 21:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056222, 282342, 49480, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  I think this would''ve worked much better had the glasses actually contributed more.  If the prescription (obviously out of control) were stronger to really change the focus to make everything else slightly ot of focus would''ve been much more impactive.  As it is it''s really nice though...</td>', 'Very nice picture.  I think this would''ve worked much better had the glasses actually contributed more.  If the prescription (obviously out of control) were stronger to really change the focus to make everything else slightly ot of focus would''ve been much more impactive.  As it is it''s really nice though...', '2006-01-18 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2056236, 279856, 49480, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would''ve worked much better as black and white.  Even still, the lights coming through the fog look really cool and the gnarly trees add a great look to the shot.</td>', 'I think this shot would''ve worked much better as black and white.  Even still, the lights coming through the fog look really cool and the gnarly trees add a great look to the shot.', '2006-01-18 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
