(2059046, 282185, 18073, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot.  Great, great composition.  I love the dizzying effect you have created by shooting and an angle.  THe muted colours are fab too with the yellow lines leading you right into the image.  Good luck!</td>', 'Fabulous shot.  Great, great composition.  I love the dizzying effect you have created by shooting and an angle.  THe muted colours are fab too with the yellow lines leading you right into the image.  Good luck!', '2006-01-19 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2059074, 281719, 50641, '<td valign="top">Me, I''m a fan of out-of-the-box shots.  I like what you''re going for here. My only problem is that I''d say she''s <i>on</i> that road, but your title asks me to think she <i>is</i> that road. Really nice portrait in any case, and she definitely looks in-between.</td>', 'Me, I''m a fan of out-of-the-box shots.  I like what you''re going for here. My only problem is that I''d say she''s on that road, but your title asks me to think she is that road. Really nice portrait in any case, and she definitely looks in-between.', '2006-01-19 10:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
