(2060109, 280266, 45586, '<td valign="top">This is very eerie and nice at the same time.</td>', 'This is very eerie and nice at the same time.', '2006-01-19 16:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060112, 280627, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the oddness of this, the suggestion of a story that you can''t quite figure out. It gets an 8. How to score higher? Not have her so perfectly centered and framed.</td>', 'I love the oddness of this, the suggestion of a story that you can''t quite figure out. It gets an 8. How to score higher? Not have her so perfectly centered and framed.', '2006-01-19 16:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060116, 281808, 45586, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. 6</td>', 'Nicely done. 6', '2006-01-19 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060120, 282579, 50695, '<td valign="top">Somehow this looks like a Manet painting. I get the same sense of life. Same excellent composition, too. 10.</td>', 'Somehow this looks like a Manet painting. I get the same sense of life. Same excellent composition, too. 10.', '2006-01-19 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060122, 282938, 50695, '<td valign="top">Dizzying abstract masterpiece! 10.</td>', 'Dizzying abstract masterpiece! 10.', '2006-01-19 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060125, 280266, 50695, '<td valign="top">Some people search so hard for a shot and then there''s that annoying so-and-so who just points his camera down at the ground and scores a 10. (That would be you :)</td>', 'Some people search so hard for a shot and then there''s that annoying so-and-so who just points his camera down at the ground and scores a 10. (That would be you :)', '2006-01-19 16:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060127, 280241, 45586, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Simple and stark.ingly emotive</td>', 'Very nice. Simple and stark.ingly emotive', '2006-01-19 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060130, 280832, 45586, '<td valign="top">Great leading line photo! A little off center though.</td>', 'Great leading line photo! A little off center though.', '2006-01-19 16:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060131, 282159, 45586, '<td valign="top">Sweet image!</td>', 'Sweet image!', '2006-01-19 16:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060132, 282927, 45586, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Love the saturation of colors.</td>', 'Nice photo. Love the saturation of colors.', '2006-01-19 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060134, 282789, 45586, '<td valign="top">Too small.</td>', 'Too small.', '2006-01-19 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060135, 282451, 50695, '<td valign="top">You bring the tracks to life with the daring maneuver of pointing directly at the sun. Some will probably penalize you for that, but for me it turns a 5 into a 9.</td>', 'You bring the tracks to life with the daring maneuver of pointing directly at the sun. Some will probably penalize you for that, but for me it turns a 5 into a 9.', '2006-01-19 16:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060140, 281610, 50695, '<td valign="top">daring composition and having your largest (only) dark object AND source of light coming from the same place makes this a 9. gorgeous light.</td>', 'daring composition and having your largest (only) dark object AND source of light coming from the same place makes this a 9. gorgeous light.', '2006-01-19 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060142, 282185, 50695, '<td valign="top">you have one hell of an eye. This seems like the best possible angle you could have chosen. 9.</td>', 'you have one hell of an eye. This seems like the best possible angle you could have chosen. 9.', '2006-01-19 16:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060143, 282472, 50695, '<td valign="top">terrific composition. and catching the plane in the rectangle catches you a 9.</td>', 'terrific composition. and catching the plane in the rectangle catches you a 9.', '2006-01-19 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060144, 281594, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the one tunnel "inside" another and the way green gives way to red at the bottom of the image. That plus great composition = 9</td>', 'love the one tunnel "inside" another and the way green gives way to red at the bottom of the image. That plus great composition = 9', '2006-01-19 16:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060147, 282541, 50695, '<td valign="top">you use time lapse to turn the river into another road. The bicycle then comes to represent some kind of longing for the impossible, for the dreamable. 9.</td>', 'you use time lapse to turn the river into another road. The bicycle then comes to represent some kind of longing for the impossible, for the dreamable. 9.', '2006-01-19 16:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060152, 281786, 50695, '<td valign="top">love how the background, fuzzy as it is, still provides a countering diagonal for the foreground. The snail seems to be at the juncture of forces greater than it can understand. I can relate! 9.</td>', 'love how the background, fuzzy as it is, still provides a countering diagonal for the foreground. The snail seems to be at the juncture of forces greater than it can understand. I can relate! 9.', '2006-01-19 16:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060161, 280028, 26318, '<td valign="top">Where is my motorcycle!  This is an odd, and amazing road.  Good picture.</td>', 'Where is my motorcycle!  This is an odd, and amazing road.  Good picture.', '2006-01-19 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060166, 282236, 26318, '<td valign="top">If I couldn''t see the cars coming, it would be a bit more impressive.</td>', 'If I couldn''t see the cars coming, it would be a bit more impressive.', '2006-01-19 16:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060170, 282635, 26318, '<td valign="top">I have always liked these photos with the streaks from taillights.</td>', 'I have always liked these photos with the streaks from taillights.', '2006-01-19 16:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060178, 282984, 26318, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like that it is in B&amp;W, it dosn''t take away from the roads, or the decission.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like that it is in B&W, it dosn''t take away from the roads, or the decission.', '2006-01-19 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060182, 282927, 26318, '<td valign="top">Good picture. I like the size and shape of the tree.</td>', 'Good picture. I like the size and shape of the tree.', '2006-01-19 16:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060187, 281389, 26318, '<td valign="top">ACK!  Interesting picture, but I don''t see a point that made it into focus, and the outside hurts my eyes.</td>', 'ACK!  Interesting picture, but I don''t see a point that made it into focus, and the outside hurts my eyes.', '2006-01-19 16:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060193, 281301, 26318, '<td valign="top">Nice caption.. picture has some interesting aspects, the field, tree, road and tombstones.  The shadows are nice, giving a good feeling of time.</td>', 'Nice caption.. picture has some interesting aspects, the field, tree, road and tombstones.  The shadows are nice, giving a good feeling of time.', '2006-01-19 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060196, 282570, 26318, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, If there was clearer skys it would improve this picture more.</td>', 'Nice photo, If there was clearer skys it would improve this picture more.', '2006-01-19 16:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060204, 281745, 26318, '<td valign="top">Very nice.   The lighting is very dramatic.  Lighting on the hair and the path is very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.   The lighting is very dramatic.  Lighting on the hair and the path is very nice.', '2006-01-19 16:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060207, 281389, 19670, '<td valign="top">Wow, this really shows a sense of motion...even makes me a little dizzy...was this done by zooming with an open shutter?</td>', 'Wow, this really shows a sense of motion...even makes me a little dizzy...was this done by zooming with an open shutter?', '2006-01-19 16:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060209, 280292, 26318, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture..  without the yellow line this would just be another side road.</td>', 'Interesting picture..  without the yellow line this would just be another side road.', '2006-01-19 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060215, 282719, 26318, '<td valign="top">Wow.. nice sky.  I like this one very much.  Always did like the taillight streaks. Good work, and good composition.  It appears to be a bit off kilter, horizon appears to fall off on the right.</td>', 'Wow.. nice sky.  I like this one very much.  Always did like the taillight streaks. Good work, and good composition.  It appears to be a bit off kilter, horizon appears to fall off on the right.', '2006-01-19 16:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060224, 282587, 19670, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this cropped so there''s less of the dirt showing. But nice to see so many of these. Don''t really see a road, though. (Aren''t those Dodge Vipers? I think the Venom is a special version of a Viper.)</td>', 'I would like to have seen this cropped so there''s less of the dirt showing. But nice to see so many of these. Don''t really see a road, though. (Aren''t those Dodge Vipers? I think the Venom is a special version of a Viper.)', '2006-01-19 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060227, 282340, 26318, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I almost get the feel that there is a printed background that she is standing in front of.</td>', 'Nice.  I almost get the feel that there is a printed background that she is standing in front of.', '2006-01-19 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060233, 282185, 19670, '<td valign="top">Really like the angle on this, and the nice shape (the intersection) the eye is led to at the bottom of the hill.</td>', 'Really like the angle on this, and the nice shape (the intersection) the eye is led to at the bottom of the hill.', '2006-01-19 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060239, 282161, 23728, '<td valign="top">What an awesome looking photo and I use the word awesome beacuse when I first looked at it I was is in Awe!</td>', 'What an awesome looking photo and I use the word awesome beacuse when I first looked at it I was is in Awe!', '2006-01-19 16:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060277, 282736, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and time of day.  Cropping out about half of the clouds, brighter levels, and bumping up saturation might be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and time of day.  Cropping out about half of the clouds, brighter levels, and bumping up saturation might be better.', '2006-01-19 16:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060282, 282940, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition.  Needs more DOF, might have to crank up ISO to avoid additional motion blur.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition.  Needs more DOF, might have to crank up ISO to avoid additional motion blur.', '2006-01-19 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060295, 282119, 44490, '<td valign="top">Foggy conditions can be interesting, but often end up gray as in this case.  Level adjustment, all of white/black/midtones, plus contrast adjustment in Photoshop would help.</td>', 'Foggy conditions can be interesting, but often end up gray as in this case.  Level adjustment, all of white/black/midtones, plus contrast adjustment in Photoshop would help.', '2006-01-19 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060311, 282390, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and soft misty feeling.  But it also feels a bit dark, brighter levels would help.  Also less central composition would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and soft misty feeling.  But it also feels a bit dark, brighter levels would help.  Also less central composition would be better.', '2006-01-19 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060314, 280433, 32132, '<td valign="top">nice idea. perfect title.</td>', 'nice idea. perfect title.', '2006-01-19 17:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060319, 281442, 32132, '<td valign="top">nice road, the clk would LOVE it!</td>', 'nice road, the clk would LOVE it!', '2006-01-19 17:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060326, 282719, 32132, '<td valign="top">Great balls of fire!!! This would have worked in the burst of color challenge as well! Nicely done!</td>', 'Great balls of fire!!! This would have worked in the burst of color challenge as well! Nicely done!', '2006-01-19 17:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060331, 282868, 32132, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, maybe alittle yellow? I''m not sure though, I have some sort of weird dislike for yellow, don''t know why. Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Beautiful, maybe alittle yellow? I''m not sure though, I have some sort of weird dislike for yellow, don''t know why. Beautiful photo!', '2006-01-19 17:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060337, 282066, 32132, '<td valign="top">the arm/torso distracts me a little, otherwise I love the look of the traveler, his expression etc..</td>', 'the arm/torso distracts me a little, otherwise I love the look of the traveler, his expression etc..', '2006-01-19 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060339, 279852, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, and lights.  It''s just too dark, needs more exposure as the point lights aren''t enough to carry the image.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, and lights.  It''s just too dark, needs more exposure as the point lights aren''t enough to carry the image.', '2006-01-19 17:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060341, 280654, 32132, '<td valign="top">gritty, nice interpretation.</td>', 'gritty, nice interpretation.', '2006-01-19 17:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060345, 282119, 32132, '<td valign="top">Love misty pics. Great shot, maybe a slight tilt? overall I like it!</td>', 'Love misty pics. Great shot, maybe a slight tilt? overall I like it!', '2006-01-19 17:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060351, 282991, 32132, '<td valign="top">nice comp. very pleasing</td>', 'nice comp. very pleasing', '2006-01-19 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060357, 282366, 32132, '<td valign="top">usually I don''t like the whole tilted thing, but thanks for showing me a great example of how it can really work. Nice job.</td>', 'usually I don''t like the whole tilted thing, but thanks for showing me a great example of how it can really work. Nice job.', '2006-01-19 17:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060368, 282945, 32132, '<td valign="top">"Believer''s unite!"</td>', '"Believer''s unite!"', '2006-01-19 17:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060375, 282798, 32132, '<td valign="top">I like it, I have a few similar shots myself!</td>', 'I like it, I have a few similar shots myself!', '2006-01-19 17:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060383, 282761, 32132, '<td valign="top">Nice "almost capture" of hover-crafts!! I like it alot!</td>', 'Nice "almost capture" of hover-crafts!! I like it alot!', '2006-01-19 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060384, 282804, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and DOF.  Branch in center foreground doesn''t really give it a chance, too bad - any way to get below it?</td>', 'Nice sharpness and DOF.  Branch in center foreground doesn''t really give it a chance, too bad - any way to get below it?', '2006-01-19 17:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060389, 283005, 32132, '<td valign="top">balanced, excelent in so many ways...color, comp., fav so far.</td>', 'balanced, excelent in so many ways...color, comp., fav so far.', '2006-01-19 17:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060395, 282457, 32132, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the crop. Looks like familar towns everywhere!</td>', 'I''m liking the crop. Looks like familar towns everywhere!', '2006-01-19 17:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060402, 282558, 32132, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda scary to me... but still a great photo!</td>', 'Looks kinda scary to me... but still a great photo!', '2006-01-19 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060410, 282975, 32132, '<td valign="top">my fav of these ground level entries, the tree line and the sky is clear and compelling!</td>', 'my fav of these ground level entries, the tree line and the sky is clear and compelling!', '2006-01-19 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060426, 280627, 32132, '<td valign="top">i might have liked this photo if the model had been wearing something dramatic and in a different pose.</td>', 'i might have liked this photo if the model had been wearing something dramatic and in a different pose.', '2006-01-19 17:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060429, 282512, 32132, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. The colors are pleasing.</td>', 'Very pretty. The colors are pleasing.', '2006-01-19 17:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060435, 282787, 32132, '<td valign="top">great shadows! I like this one alot</td>', 'great shadows! I like this one alot', '2006-01-19 17:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060445, 282632, 32132, '<td valign="top">Love the comp. I''m not sure if it''s just my monitor but the sky color seems kinda green..? Nice photo!</td>', 'Love the comp. I''m not sure if it''s just my monitor but the sky color seems kinda green..? Nice photo!', '2006-01-19 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060448, 281320, 32132, '<td valign="top">very charming and enchanting countryside photo!</td>', 'very charming and enchanting countryside photo!', '2006-01-19 17:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060453, 282541, 32132, '<td valign="top">artistic and compelling, key ingredients. Nice entry!</td>', 'artistic and compelling, key ingredients. Nice entry!', '2006-01-19 17:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060463, 280927, 32132, '<td valign="top">Very unique for a "road between the trees" photo. I like it very much!</td>', 'Very unique for a "road between the trees" photo. I like it very much!', '2006-01-19 17:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060473, 282161, 32132, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the "orange", unexpected. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the effect of the "orange", unexpected. Nice job!', '2006-01-19 17:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060479, 282984, 32132, '<td valign="top">definately the high road!</td>', 'definately the high road!', '2006-01-19 17:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060490, 282889, 32132, '<td valign="top">or "Make Your Own Road" nice photo, kinda wish it was lighter though...</td>', 'or "Make Your Own Road" nice photo, kinda wish it was lighter though...', '2006-01-19 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060515, 282927, 32132, '<td valign="top">I love it, is it tilted or am I?</td>', 'I love it, is it tilted or am I?', '2006-01-19 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060518, 280691, 32132, '<td valign="top">surreal, beautiful!</td>', 'surreal, beautiful!', '2006-01-19 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060527, 282685, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, color, sharpness, and DOF.  Cropping out bottom 1/4 would be better and still leave plenty of road.</td>', 'Nice idea, color, sharpness, and DOF.  Cropping out bottom 1/4 would be better and still leave plenty of road.', '2006-01-19 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060528, 281719, 44490, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, lighting, sharpness, composition, etc.  I can guess the concern over meeting the challenge, maybe some action like playing coy with makeup, fan, goggles, or flipper would have been enough of a tie-in?  Best wishes.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, lighting, sharpness, composition, etc.  I can guess the concern over meeting the challenge, maybe some action like playing coy with makeup, fan, goggles, or flipper would have been enough of a tie-in?  Best wishes.', '2006-01-19 17:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060529, 282975, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for extreme close-to-ground, colors, sharpness, DOF, and compostion.  Cropping out some of the bottom would be better, less out-of-focus foreground and distracting break in the pavement and image.</td>', 'Nice idea for extreme close-to-ground, colors, sharpness, DOF, and compostion.  Cropping out some of the bottom would be better, less out-of-focus foreground and distracting break in the pavement and image.', '2006-01-19 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060530, 282530, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, contrast, and sharpness.  Less straight-up-the-middle stairway would be better, although I can see that you have only a few degrees in either direction before the foliage starts to obscure.</td>', 'Nice idea, contrast, and sharpness.  Less straight-up-the-middle stairway would be better, although I can see that you have only a few degrees in either direction before the foliage starts to obscure.', '2006-01-19 17:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060531, 282293, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness, DOF, and image of city over the hill.  Cropping out bottom foreground would probably be better.</td>', 'Nice sharpness, DOF, and image of city over the hill.  Cropping out bottom foreground would probably be better.', '2006-01-19 17:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060534, 282254, 32132, '<td valign="top">This could be an eviromental ad! How great would an old Indian man with a tear be? I''m telling my age--sorry, NICE photo.</td>', 'This could be an eviromental ad! How great would an old Indian man with a tear be? I''m telling my age--sorry, NICE photo.', '2006-01-19 17:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060536, 279757, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, composition, lines, and DOF.  A little more angle and brighter levels would help, as overall image feels too dark.</td>', 'Nice idea, composition, lines, and DOF.  A little more angle and brighter levels would help, as overall image feels too dark.', '2006-01-19 17:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060539, 282648, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, sharpness, and DOF.  Would be better cropping 1/4 of bottom as the yellow road is overwhelmingly dominant.</td>', 'Nice colors, sharpness, and DOF.  Would be better cropping 1/4 of bottom as the yellow road is overwhelmingly dominant.', '2006-01-19 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060540, 282252, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, sharpness, and DOF, interesting gate.  Might be better if the gate were a little closer and larger - more featured, with less road in front and more road behind?  Also, I''d gently suggest getting over the odd-angle stage quickly, save it for the rare cases where it will really help instead of distract most viewers.</td>', 'Nice colors, sharpness, and DOF, interesting gate.  Might be better if the gate were a little closer and larger - more featured, with less road in front and more road behind?  Also, I''d gently suggest getting over the odd-angle stage quickly, save it for the rare cases where it will really help instead of distract most viewers.', '2006-01-19 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060542, 282185, 43774, '<td valign="top">Extreme angle which I normally don''t like, but it made me examine the photo more that I normally would, so high marks from me. Clarity is excellent, colour and road are interesting.</td>', 'Extreme angle which I normally don''t like, but it made me examine the photo more that I normally would, so high marks from me. Clarity is excellent, colour and road are interesting.', '2006-01-19 17:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060544, 279856, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, a tad dark but I think that adds to the mood/feeling.</td>', 'Nice, a tad dark but I think that adds to the mood/feeling.', '2006-01-19 17:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060545, 280910, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like it.</td>', 'Nice, I like it.', '2006-01-19 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060553, 280350, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this relates to the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know how this relates to the challenge.', '2006-01-19 17:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060554, 281445, 43774, '<td valign="top">Too over exposed. If there is a road there I can''t see it.</td>', 'Too over exposed. If there is a road there I can''t see it.', '2006-01-19 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060556, 282449, 32132, '<td valign="top">clever title, I like it very much, nice blue.</td>', 'clever title, I like it very much, nice blue.', '2006-01-19 17:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2060558, 280620, 43774, '<td valign="top">Too contrast-y, out of focus.</td>', 'Too contrast-y, out of focus.', '2006-01-19 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
