(2062003, 282340, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a striking photo!  The white of the snow and the blue-gray day contrasted against the lady in black!  Awesome!  This is my pick for blue!  It deserves to have top billing in this challenge.  Good luck!  10</td>', 'This is such a striking photo!  The white of the snow and the blue-gray day contrasted against the lady in black!  Awesome!  This is my pick for blue!  It deserves to have top billing in this challenge.  Good luck!  10', '2006-01-19 23:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062004, 282427, 29269, '<td valign="top">My fellow Austinite, nice cityscape, (a little too much of a wide angle distortion though), nice colors, and juxtaposition of new Frost tower against the old(er) architecture.<br/>However, it does not scream "Road" at me. Granted, there is a road in the photo but it hardly represents a major element that attracts the observer''s attention. average-6.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'My fellow Austinite, nice cityscape, (a little too much of a wide angle distortion though), nice colors, and juxtaposition of new Frost tower against the old(er) architecture.However, it does not scream "Road" at me. Granted, there is a road in the photo but it hardly represents a major element that attracts the observer''s attention. average-6.Good luck!', '2006-01-19 23:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062008, 282239, 24454, '<td valign="top">Man, I love the free-spirited feel of this picture.  It''s a standout in this challenge.  The subject is tack sharp.  Its an interesting road, and composed great!  Good luck!!!  Should be right up there at the top!</td>', 'Man, I love the free-spirited feel of this picture.  It''s a standout in this challenge.  The subject is tack sharp.  Its an interesting road, and composed great!  Good luck!!!  Should be right up there at the top!', '2006-01-19 23:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062010, 282141, 24454, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a stunning road!  And beautifully captured!  My pick for one of the top 3 for sure!!!  10</td>', 'Now THAT is a stunning road!  And beautifully captured!  My pick for one of the top 3 for sure!!!  10', '2006-01-19 23:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062015, 282672, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  So far, I''d say this definitely should be in the top 3 here!  Good luck.</td>', 'Very well done!  So far, I''d say this definitely should be in the top 3 here!  Good luck.', '2006-01-19 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062016, 282342, 29269, '<td valign="top">You definitively picked the narrow gate for this challenge. Short-term, this road may lead you to destruction:-) But, follow your instincts and make photos for yourself, not to please others. Congratulations on the brave entry that will definitively end up with strange voting curve, with 2 or 3 peaks.<br/>As far as the choice of looking through the glasses, it is a nice prop, although you could have found some stronger lenses to accentuate this text some more by putting the rest more out of focus. This way, only the rim makes the text stand out.</td>', 'You definitively picked the narrow gate for this challenge. Short-term, this road may lead you to destruction:-) But, follow your instincts and make photos for yourself, not to please others. Congratulations on the brave entry that will definitively end up with strange voting curve, with 2 or 3 peaks.As far as the choice of looking through the glasses, it is a nice prop, although you could have found some stronger lenses to accentuate this text some more by putting the rest more out of focus. This way, only the rim makes the text stand out.', '2006-01-19 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062022, 282927, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!!!   This is definitely one of the best road pictures in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very pretty!!!   This is definitely one of the best road pictures in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2006-01-19 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062030, 281320, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Very refreshing in this challenge. Great road to photograph in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome!  Very refreshing in this challenge. Great road to photograph in this challenge.', '2006-01-19 23:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062034, 282604, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!   One of the top photos in this challenge for sure!</td>', 'This is awesome!   One of the top photos in this challenge for sure!', '2006-01-19 23:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062036, 281808, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is beautiful!</td>', 'That is beautiful!', '2006-01-19 23:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062038, 280028, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is stunning!  Great subject for this challenge.  Good luck.  To me it looks pretty perfect!</td>', 'That is stunning!  Great subject for this challenge.  Good luck.  To me it looks pretty perfect!', '2006-01-19 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062040, 282945, 29269, '<td valign="top">It is not the book that is the road to salvation, it is following what it prescribes with pure heart that IS the road to salvation. I''ll take it that way... OK. Negative space is powerful, enhances the main subject. However, not a ribbon-quality photo. Congratulations on the bravery to submit something out-of-the-box and good luck.</td>', 'It is not the book that is the road to salvation, it is following what it prescribes with pure heart that IS the road to salvation. I''ll take it that way... OK. Negative space is powerful, enhances the main subject. However, not a ribbon-quality photo. Congratulations on the bravery to submit something out-of-the-box and good luck.', '2006-01-19 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062044, 282719, 29269, '<td valign="top">Good old Commonwealth - driving on the wrong side of the road!? One of the better trails of light on the road, complete with the long stretch and a pretty sunset. Should finish top-25, I hope.</td>', 'Good old Commonwealth - driving on the wrong side of the road!? One of the better trails of light on the road, complete with the long stretch and a pretty sunset. Should finish top-25, I hope.', '2006-01-19 23:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062047, 282798, 29269, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful! I tried to do a similar rear-view mirror thingie, but this is right up there, top-5. Nothing to suggest here within basic rules, nothing to add or subtract (if you want to, you could clone out that line in the mirror after the challenge), pure 10.</td>', 'Simply beautiful! I tried to do a similar rear-view mirror thingie, but this is right up there, top-5. Nothing to suggest here within basic rules, nothing to add or subtract (if you want to, you could clone out that line in the mirror after the challenge), pure 10.', '2006-01-19 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062053, 282340, 29269, '<td valign="top">Wow! I haven''t gone through all the images, but I have a feeling that I won''t find a better one. Great contrast, good composition. One thing I would have tried is a different crop. Centered composition is rarely the best choice, especially since the bottom of your photo is dark. I would have  cropped out most of the road in front of her feet.<br/> <br/>Bump up to 10 on second pass. I found some better ones now that I''m done with them all, but this is still a yellow or a red ribbon potential IMO.</td>', 'Wow! I haven''t gone through all the images, but I have a feeling that I won''t find a better one. Great contrast, good composition. One thing I would have tried is a different crop. Centered composition is rarely the best choice, especially since the bottom of your photo is dark. I would have  cropped out most of the road in front of her feet. Bump up to 10 on second pass. I found some better ones now that I''m done with them all, but this is still a yellow or a red ribbon potential IMO.', '2006-01-19 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062061, 280028, 29269, '<td valign="top">This has a potential to earn the spot on the dpc home page for a week. Fantastic find! One thing I would recommend is coming back here (if at all possible and if you''re interested) when the weather is better, and when the sun is higher up in the sky. Having the valley better lighted and not having that shadow on the right slope, with deeper blue color for the sky would make this befitting the cover of National Geographic magazine.</td>', 'This has a potential to earn the spot on the dpc home page for a week. Fantastic find! One thing I would recommend is coming back here (if at all possible and if you''re interested) when the weather is better, and when the sun is higher up in the sky. Having the valley better lighted and not having that shadow on the right slope, with deeper blue color for the sky would make this befitting the cover of National Geographic magazine.', '2006-01-19 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2062327, 280555, 48467, '<td valign="top">As seen on the cover of Modest Mouse''s "This Is a Long Drive for Someone With Nothing to Think About."</td>', 'As seen on the cover of Modest Mouse''s "This Is a Long Drive for Someone With Nothing to Think About."', '2006-01-20 01:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
