(2066876, 282927, 5354, '<td valign="top">Shame you chose the same title as several other entries - but i guess this is an image contest not a title contest ;-0<br/>Like the autumn colours, golds and browns. Like the sweep of the road. Needs something else to allow the eye to rest at the end of the road. A cow, horse, bike, car - just a full stop / period.</td>', 'Shame you chose the same title as several other entries - but i guess this is an image contest not a title contest ;-0Like the autumn colours, golds and browns. Like the sweep of the road. Needs something else to allow the eye to rest at the end of the road. A cow, horse, bike, car - just a full stop / period.', '2006-01-21 05:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066877, 282159, 5354, '<td valign="top">Haha - first one to make me laugh - great work ;-)</td>', 'Haha - first one to make me laugh - great work ;-)', '2006-01-21 05:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066879, 282077, 5354, '<td valign="top">OK I''m gessing you are in Asia somewhere, possibly India - so am I for the next week or so.<br/>These rickies are a great source of images if you find the trick to capturing them. Stand at the side of the road with a 50 mm lens, set the exposure to 1/20th second and pan with the passing ricky. Many will be blurred, but one or two will be pin sharp with the background well out of focus. Try it it real fun, you get so many strange looks from passers by ;-)</td>', 'OK I''m gessing you are in Asia somewhere, possibly India - so am I for the next week or so.These rickies are a great source of images if you find the trick to capturing them. Stand at the side of the road with a 50 mm lens, set the exposure to 1/20th second and pan with the passing ricky. Many will be blurred, but one or two will be pin sharp with the background well out of focus. Try it it real fun, you get so many strange looks from passers by ;-)', '2006-01-21 06:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2066881, 282122, 5354, '<td valign="top">Over exposed, bland and without a real point to the photo.<br/>Sorry thats rude, but its my honest 1st impression, and those are probably the same thoughts that many voters had before skipping on.</td>', 'Over exposed, bland and without a real point to the photo.Sorry thats rude, but its my honest 1st impression, and those are probably the same thoughts that many voters had before skipping on.', '2006-01-21 06:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
