(2066960, 282342, 5354, '<td valign="top">We tend to get one of these book and glasses images every challenge. I guess its easier than actually getting out and taking an image of something slightly more interesting.<br/> <br/>However, it tends to get repetitive and dull in the extreme after a couple of years. This may be your first attempt, but the genre is just so tired now. Please try to be a little more creative.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry if that is a little brutal but someone has to be honest instead of just pressing ''4'' and skipping on to the next challenge entry.</td>', 'We tend to get one of these book and glasses images every challenge. I guess its easier than actually getting out and taking an image of something slightly more interesting. However, it tends to get repetitive and dull in the extreme after a couple of years. This may be your first attempt, but the genre is just so tired now. Please try to be a little more creative. I''m sorry if that is a little brutal but someone has to be honest instead of just pressing ''4'' and skipping on to the next challenge entry.', '2006-01-21 08:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
