(2068873, 282122, 50715, '<td valign="top">Tough scene to shoot, very high contrast - the blown-out highlights on the wall at the left are very distracting.  Also a little bland, no obvious centre of interest - perhaps zooming to lose some of the wall and emphasise the gate a bit more would help?</td>', 'Tough scene to shoot, very high contrast - the blown-out highlights on the wall at the left are very distracting.  Also a little bland, no obvious centre of interest - perhaps zooming to lose some of the wall and emphasise the gate a bit more would help?', '2006-01-21 20:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
