(2072862, 282185, 30982, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t care for off-angle pics, but this one works very well indeed!</td>', 'Normally I don''t care for off-angle pics, but this one works very well indeed!', '2006-01-22 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073226, 280620, 46094, '<td valign="top">Wish Resolution requirements weren''t so low... probably beautiful just one or two more MPS in density.  I love the way the road and the horizon and the branches and the shadows all gnarl to form a mutual spiral.  Very good picture, and I love the perspective it gives with black and white.</td>', 'Wish Resolution requirements weren''t so low... probably beautiful just one or two more MPS in density.  I love the way the road and the horizon and the branches and the shadows all gnarl to form a mutual spiral.  Very good picture, and I love the perspective it gives with black and white.', '2006-01-23 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073342, 282992, 44058, '<td valign="top">nice graveyard =)</td>', 'nice graveyard =)', '2006-01-23 03:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073347, 282566, 43589, '<td valign="top">Lucky people.9.</td>', 'Lucky people.9.', '2006-01-23 03:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073350, 282736, 51437, '<td valign="top">I like how you didn''t crop off all that sky up there and balance remains.</td>', 'I like how you didn''t crop off all that sky up there and balance remains.', '2006-01-23 03:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073358, 280667, 51437, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the fish-eye lens.  You found a good position along the road for this shot.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the use of the fish-eye lens.  You found a good position along the road for this shot.  Good work.', '2006-01-23 03:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073367, 279905, 51437, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this photo would feel with the subjects in motion - walking down the road.  I think that would have been more interesting than being left to ponder about what they are pondering.  I am left feeling that their car is about 10 feet behind the camera. :)</td>', 'I wonder how this photo would feel with the subjects in motion - walking down the road.  I think that would have been more interesting than being left to ponder about what they are pondering.  I am left feeling that their car is about 10 feet behind the camera. :)', '2006-01-23 04:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073368, 280266, 51437, '<td valign="top">silent... but deadly</td>', 'silent... but deadly', '2006-01-23 04:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073369, 282927, 51437, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I like the warm tones.  I like the tree.  I like the composition.  This is the road I would take.</td>', 'I like it.  I like the warm tones.  I like the tree.  I like the composition.  This is the road I would take.', '2006-01-23 04:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073372, 280028, 21604, '<td valign="top">What a great looking road. Beautiful scenery too. Its just a bit soft on places. nice shot tho.</td>', 'What a great looking road. Beautiful scenery too. Its just a bit soft on places. nice shot tho.', '2006-01-23 04:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073374, 282053, 51437, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if the keep out sign helps this photo or not.</td>', 'I can''t decide if the keep out sign helps this photo or not.', '2006-01-23 04:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073377, 282541, 21604, '<td valign="top">It may have been done a lot - but I do love long exposure on flowing water. Really nice shot.</td>', 'It may have been done a lot - but I do love long exposure on flowing water. Really nice shot.', '2006-01-23 04:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073378, 281434, 51437, '<td valign="top">This photo tells me that you are a "stop to smell the roses" kind of photographer.  Am I correct?</td>', 'This photo tells me that you are a "stop to smell the roses" kind of photographer.  Am I correct?', '2006-01-23 04:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073379, 282185, 21604, '<td valign="top">Wow - this shot has a lot of impact. Love the angle chosen. The colors are great too. 10.</td>', 'Wow - this shot has a lot of impact. Love the angle chosen. The colors are great too. 10.', '2006-01-23 04:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073380, 282123, 51437, '<td valign="top">cool.  good title too.</td>', 'cool.  good title too.', '2006-01-23 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073381, 282239, 51437, '<td valign="top">That is one funky bike man!</td>', 'That is one funky bike man!', '2006-01-23 04:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073382, 282591, 51437, '<td valign="top">looks more like side of the road</td>', 'looks more like side of the road', '2006-01-23 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073383, 282932, 21604, '<td valign="top">Its an interesting concept, but I think that a different angle would make it better. As it is, it is difficult to look at - I just want to flip the image.</td>', 'Its an interesting concept, but I think that a different angle would make it better. As it is, it is difficult to look at - I just want to flip the image.', '2006-01-23 04:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073384, 282170, 51437, '<td valign="top">I keep getting drawn upward to the beautiful colors in that scenery and sky - what a blue!</td>', 'I keep getting drawn upward to the beautiful colors in that scenery and sky - what a blue!', '2006-01-23 04:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073385, 282577, 21604, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a really nice shot, but it lacks impact or a focal point. I don''t mind the blurry light trails, they add to a sense of movement.</td>', 'I think this could have been a really nice shot, but it lacks impact or a focal point. I don''t mind the blurry light trails, they add to a sense of movement.', '2006-01-23 04:27:03.000000', NULL, 1);
