(2073387, 280555, 51437, '<td valign="top">Very fresh - and freezing cold - looking at this makes me want to grab a blanket!  Did you use some kind of IR (infrared) setting or filter?</td>', 'Very fresh - and freezing cold - looking at this makes me want to grab a blanket!  Did you use some kind of IR (infrared) setting or filter?', '2006-01-23 04:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073389, 280555, 21604, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a shot. Love the choice of IR. 9.</td>', 'Wow - what a shot. Love the choice of IR. 9.', '2006-01-23 04:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073391, 282314, 21604, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I hope everyone else gets it and it gets the score it deserves. well done for using some imagination instead of just picking the obvious.  Technically, really nice shot - lovely tones &amp; good sharpness. 9.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I hope everyone else gets it and it gets the score it deserves. well done for using some imagination instead of just picking the obvious.  Technically, really nice shot - lovely tones & good sharpness. 9.', '2006-01-23 04:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073420, 282972, 51437, '<td valign="top">freaky</td>', 'freaky', '2006-01-23 05:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073436, 282648, 51437, '<td valign="top">Looks like you got some crap in your optics while on the farm.  Otherwise, great photo, very vivid colors.</td>', 'Looks like you got some crap in your optics while on the farm.  Otherwise, great photo, very vivid colors.', '2006-01-23 05:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073461, 282449, 35830, '<td valign="top">wow nice picture i think road goes to heaven.</td>', 'wow nice picture i think road goes to heaven.', '2006-01-23 05:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2073815, 281442, 48228, '<td valign="top">I like this, as it is the type of image I would like to photograpy myself. I love deep forrests and moss..... Very pleasing composition, very well done.</td>', 'I like this, as it is the type of image I would like to photograpy myself. I love deep forrests and moss..... Very pleasing composition, very well done.', '2006-01-23 09:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
