(2073859, 280727, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is just great, and I love the perspective, with the road disappearing into the distance.....The trees and leaves, are dappled with light, quite magical, very well done.....</td>', 'This is just great, and I love the perspective, with the road disappearing into the distance.....The trees and leaves, are dappled with light, quite magical, very well done.....', '2006-01-23 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
