(2074166, 280028, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, pretty good sharpness and DOF, very interesting vantage point and disappearing roadway, great mountains. One of my top picks for the challenge, hope that it does well.</td>', 'Nice colors, pretty good sharpness and DOF, very interesting vantage point and disappearing roadway, great mountains. One of my top picks for the challenge, hope that it does well.', '2006-01-23 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074170, 282789, 49613, '<td valign="top">It looks good, but the photo is too small. Use the 640 pixels.<br/>Good one anyway.</td>', 'It looks good, but the photo is too small. Use the 640 pixels.Good one anyway.', '2006-01-23 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074175, 282993, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lights, sharpness, DOF, pretty good composition.  I keep coming back to this image for another look.  One of my top picks for this challenge, hope that it does well, especially from a fellow New Jerseyan.</td>', 'Nice lights, sharpness, DOF, pretty good composition.  I keep coming back to this image for another look.  One of my top picks for this challenge, hope that it does well, especially from a fellow New Jerseyan.', '2006-01-23 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074181, 282340, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely feeling, elegant and effective.  I usually comment on too central composition, but it works for special cases, like here.</td>', 'Lovely feeling, elegant and effective.  I usually comment on too central composition, but it works for special cases, like here.', '2006-01-23 11:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074186, 281442, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, with interesting curves of the moss covered wall and double yellow line.  Wondering where the opening in the wall leads to?  Wonderful.</td>', 'Lovely image, with interesting curves of the moss covered wall and double yellow line.  Wondering where the opening in the wall leads to?  Wonderful.', '2006-01-23 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074190, 282141, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, arcs, lights, and reflections.  Good composition, sharpness, and DOF.  Hope that it does well.</td>', 'Lovely colors, arcs, lights, and reflections.  Good composition, sharpness, and DOF.  Hope that it does well.', '2006-01-23 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074198, 280397, 44490, '<td valign="top">Striking mosaic-like reflection of the roadway in the buillding, very interesting illusion of continuous roadway through the building.  Nice sharpness and DOF, wish you could have used layers to recover the levels on the left.  Love it.</td>', 'Striking mosaic-like reflection of the roadway in the buillding, very interesting illusion of continuous roadway through the building.  Nice sharpness and DOF, wish you could have used layers to recover the levels on the left.  Love it.', '2006-01-23 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074199, 280102, 44689, '<td valign="top">I think the image would have been better if it had been color balanced a little more.</td>', 'I think the image would have been better if it had been color balanced a little more.', '2006-01-23 11:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074202, 282719, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice curving lines of light tied into the sunset colors.  Striking and effective, good composition, color manipulation, and title, all tied together.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice curving lines of light tied into the sunset colors.  Striking and effective, good composition, color manipulation, and title, all tied together.  Well done.', '2006-01-23 11:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074204, 282694, 44490, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharpness, DOF, exposure, and composition.  Love it and plan to add to my few favorites.</td>', 'Excellent sharpness, DOF, exposure, and composition.  Love it and plan to add to my few favorites.', '2006-01-23 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074214, 281320, 44490, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, nice feeling from the snow and disappearing roadway.  While building adds a little interest, the in-shadow foreground doesn''t have the detail of the rest of the image, probably nothing you can do given the sun''s lighting.  Regardless, I like it.</td>', 'Lovely image, nice feeling from the snow and disappearing roadway.  While building adds a little interest, the in-shadow foreground doesn''t have the detail of the rest of the image, probably nothing you can do given the sun''s lighting.  Regardless, I like it.', '2006-01-23 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074222, 282587, 44490, '<td valign="top">Good capture of so many Venom''s.  Maybe tighter cropping out of the fence and foreground dirt would be even better, even if it cuts through roof-lines?  Love it.</td>', 'Good capture of so many Venom''s.  Maybe tighter cropping out of the fence and foreground dirt would be even better, even if it cuts through roof-lines?  Love it.', '2006-01-23 12:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074231, 282427, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting comparison of architecture style and color.  Nice sharpness and DOF.  Probably wish for T/S lens or perspective adjustment, but that''s a nit.  The image is striking, and the flag is proudly displayed.</td>', 'Interesting comparison of architecture style and color.  Nice sharpness and DOF.  Probably wish for T/S lens or perspective adjustment, but that''s a nit.  The image is striking, and the flag is proudly displayed.', '2006-01-23 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074283, 282934, 34337, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve already gotten a lot of comments on how small this is.  Great scenery though.  4.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve already gotten a lot of comments on how small this is.  Great scenery though.  4.', '2006-01-23 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074289, 280691, 34337, '<td valign="top">Great contrast here.</td>', 'Great contrast here.', '2006-01-23 12:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074291, 282860, 34337, '<td valign="top">Photo Effect:  amazing and weird at the same time.  very original.  I would be super impressed if you could ever duplicate this.</td>', 'Photo Effect:  amazing and weird at the same time.  very original.  I would be super impressed if you could ever duplicate this.', '2006-01-23 12:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074292, 282736, 34337, '<td valign="top">More sky than road.  Cool shot though. 5.</td>', 'More sky than road.  Cool shot though. 5.', '2006-01-23 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074298, 282798, 34337, '<td valign="top">Best vehicle mirror shot that I''ve seen on this site.  Too bad about the antenna or line in the mirror.  Great comp though. 6.</td>', 'Best vehicle mirror shot that I''ve seen on this site.  Too bad about the antenna or line in the mirror.  Great comp though. 6.', '2006-01-23 12:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074309, 282604, 34337, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2006-01-23 12:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074427, 282632, 46288, '<td valign="top">Beatiful composition. Fence and clouds going together in a perfect harmony...</td>', 'Beatiful composition. Fence and clouds going together in a perfect harmony...', '2006-01-23 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074433, 279856, 46288, '<td valign="top">Beatiful trees. The yellow lines really drive us to the end. The car lights coming from the centre of the image are also a good shot.</td>', 'Beatiful trees. The yellow lines really drive us to the end. The car lights coming from the centre of the image are also a good shot.', '2006-01-23 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074440, 282120, 46288, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2006-01-23 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074462, 282254, 46288, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOV</td>', 'Interesting DOV', '2006-01-23 13:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074480, 280667, 46288, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good eye</td>', 'Nice composition, good eye', '2006-01-23 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074488, 281745, 46288, '<td valign="top">I like the golden effect created by the light. Nice road.</td>', 'I like the golden effect created by the light. Nice road.', '2006-01-23 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074489, 279905, 46288, '<td valign="top">It seems to be a bit sad, perhaps more romantic, anyway nice shot, beatiful trees and good effect</td>', 'It seems to be a bit sad, perhaps more romantic, anyway nice shot, beatiful trees and good effect', '2006-01-23 13:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074512, 282216, 46288, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. I like the mountains, the sky and the red road. Nice shot</td>', 'I love the composition. I like the mountains, the sky and the red road. Nice shot', '2006-01-23 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074530, 280505, 44689, '<td valign="top">A nice idea... could there have been a better way to shoot this though? Perhaps a different angle or perhaps using some sort of framing device in order to create a more dynamic composition? It seems very two dimensional to me. Try thinking of ways to draw the view into the picture, rather than having them just look at it.</td>', 'A nice idea... could there have been a better way to shoot this though? Perhaps a different angle or perhaps using some sort of framing device in order to create a more dynamic composition? It seems very two dimensional to me. Try thinking of ways to draw the view into the picture, rather than having them just look at it.', '2006-01-23 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074537, 282508, 44689, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea! Try playing with the color temperature a little bit (if you shot raw). Just a thought.</td>', 'Very cool idea! Try playing with the color temperature a little bit (if you shot raw). Just a thought.', '2006-01-23 14:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074551, 282975, 46288, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, excellent POV. I feel inside the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, excellent POV. I feel inside the photo.', '2006-01-23 14:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074573, 282390, 46288, '<td valign="top">Blue and terrific. Nice DOV and beatiful composition</td>', 'Blue and terrific. Nice DOV and beatiful composition', '2006-01-23 14:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2074597, 282161, 46288, '<td valign="top">I love the colour of the image. Nice shot</td>', 'I love the colour of the image. Nice shot', '2006-01-23 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
