(2075097, 280251, 9747, '<td valign="top">The sun rays kind of interferes with the picture although I think I see what you''re going for, in conjunction to the title name. It''s hard to tell that the foreground is part of a road (had to take a closer look) and the colors are too muted. However, if that''s the effect you''re going for, good job! I like how you placed the sun near the top and in center between the trees. That helps pull the picture together. Overall, nice shot!</td>', 'The sun rays kind of interferes with the picture although I think I see what you''re going for, in conjunction to the title name. It''s hard to tell that the foreground is part of a road (had to take a closer look) and the colors are too muted. However, if that''s the effect you''re going for, good job! I like how you placed the sun near the top and in center between the trees. That helps pull the picture together. Overall, nice shot!', '2006-01-23 17:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2075107, 281445, 9747, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what''s going on here. Less brightness and more contrast probably would help enhance the picture but that''s just my opinion. I don''t know why, but the verticalness combined with the blurriness of the trees in the background has an interesting effect. Nice borders!</td>', 'Hard to tell what''s going on here. Less brightness and more contrast probably would help enhance the picture but that''s just my opinion. I don''t know why, but the verticalness combined with the blurriness of the trees in the background has an interesting effect. Nice borders!', '2006-01-23 17:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2075121, 282975, 9747, '<td valign="top">I think the camera is way too low to the ground but it does give an interesting perspective on an otherwise ordinary shot. Creative! The trees seem too dark for me but they''re nicely outlined by the blue sky which appeals to me.</td>', 'I think the camera is way too low to the ground but it does give an interesting perspective on an otherwise ordinary shot. Creative! The trees seem too dark for me but they''re nicely outlined by the blue sky which appeals to me.', '2006-01-23 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
