(2076116, 282340, 45596, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Nice concept.  I''m interested to know how use obtained the gradiant effect, i.e. bright center, yet darker around the edges.  Again, great photo.  congrats.</td>', 'Awesome!  Nice concept.  I''m interested to know how use obtained the gradiant effect, i.e. bright center, yet darker around the edges.  Again, great photo.  congrats.', '2006-01-23 21:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
