(2076198, 282357, 45596, '<td valign="top">I''m looking forward to reading the comments on this one.  From my perspective, its a well put together photo.  I don''t think photos of plastic models do well here.</td>', 'I''m looking forward to reading the comments on this one.  From my perspective, its a well put together photo.  I don''t think photos of plastic models do well here.', '2006-01-23 22:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
