(2076241, 282449, 45596, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  Nice perspective and concept.  The title illustrates a sense of humor.  The colors are appropriate.  It seems a tad bit grainy, but that''s to be expected in low light conditions.  Overall, an excellent photo.</td>', 'I like this photo.  Nice perspective and concept.  The title illustrates a sense of humor.  The colors are appropriate.  It seems a tad bit grainy, but that''s to be expected in low light conditions.  Overall, an excellent photo.', '2006-01-23 22:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
