(2076257, 280102, 45596, '<td valign="top">The road looks too purple for my tastes.</td>', 'The road looks too purple for my tastes.', '2006-01-23 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076258, 281808, 45596, '<td valign="top">Cool pic.</td>', 'Cool pic.', '2006-01-23 22:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076359, 281259, 2333, '<td valign="top">Per your forum post, I''d like to give you my view of what the comment by Falc refers to... the commentor may choose to correct me if I''m wrong when the comments become visible after the close of voting.<br/>Your shot refers to the road as a "road to dreams," implying that the basketball court can be a place where dreams come true. That''s truly an American attitude, more than anywhere else in the world most likely. that''s probably a large component of what the commentor, who is from the UK, is talking about.<br/>He also points to specific things, exposure, composition, etc. that don''t appeal to him, and suggests avenues for improvement. Don''t take these as negatives, but use them to learn and to take your photography to the next level.</td>', 'Per your forum post, I''d like to give you my view of what the comment by Falc refers to... the commentor may choose to correct me if I''m wrong when the comments become visible after the close of voting.Your shot refers to the road as a "road to dreams," implying that the basketball court can be a place where dreams come true. That''s truly an American attitude, more than anywhere else in the world most likely. that''s probably a large component of what the commentor, who is from the UK, is talking about.He also points to specific things, exposure, composition, etc. that don''t appeal to him, and suggests avenues for improvement. Don''t take these as negatives, but use them to learn and to take your photography to the next level.', '2006-01-23 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076465, 280927, 25921, '<td valign="top">This is so boring.  Terrible shot.  It doesn''t have any sense of symmetry or balance to it.  And the DOF is pathetic....<br/> <br/>10.  Congrats on the ribbon forthcoming.  In the least, this one deserves it.</td>', 'This is so boring.  Terrible shot.  It doesn''t have any sense of symmetry or balance to it.  And the DOF is pathetic.... 10.  Congrats on the ribbon forthcoming.  In the least, this one deserves it.', '2006-01-23 23:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076486, 282861, 46336, '<td valign="top">Not really sure where to start. Taken, if I''m any judge, from a moving car in poor light conditions. These are very dificult conditions to say the least. Unfortunately nothing is in focus. I''m not sure if this is because the subjects are all moving (relative to your stationary position in the car), or because of camera shake due to the longer shutter speed needed for the shot.</td>', 'Not really sure where to start. Taken, if I''m any judge, from a moving car in poor light conditions. These are very dificult conditions to say the least. Unfortunately nothing is in focus. I''m not sure if this is because the subjects are all moving (relative to your stationary position in the car), or because of camera shake due to the longer shutter speed needed for the shot.', '2006-01-23 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076503, 282932, 46336, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective. I''m afraid the 180 degree rotation doesn''t really do it for me. I couldn''t be bothered to turm my monitor upside-down so I''ll rate it as is. <br/>It looks to be in good focus, and the leading lines do draw me in. I think I''ll upgrade on my original vote. why did you rotate?</td>', 'An interesting perspective. I''m afraid the 180 degree rotation doesn''t really do it for me. I couldn''t be bothered to turm my monitor upside-down so I''ll rate it as is. It looks to be in good focus, and the leading lines do draw me in. I think I''ll upgrade on my original vote. why did you rotate?', '2006-01-23 23:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076518, 282860, 46336, '<td valign="top">i think I like the idea here. It''s a shame nothing is really in focus. I''m assuming this was taken from a moving car (in the dark no less), a very challenging job. I like the composition, and would have lovedd to see the second car (further away) in focus. I think I''ll upgrade my original score now that I''ve had a good think.</td>', 'i think I like the idea here. It''s a shame nothing is really in focus. I''m assuming this was taken from a moving car (in the dark no less), a very challenging job. I like the composition, and would have lovedd to see the second car (further away) in focus. I think I''ll upgrade my original score now that I''ve had a good think.', '2006-01-23 23:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076523, 282577, 46336, '<td valign="top">Alas, nothing in focus. Based on the light swiggles I guess this is down to camera-shke on a longer shutter speed.</td>', 'Alas, nothing in focus. Based on the light swiggles I guess this is down to camera-shke on a longer shutter speed.', '2006-01-23 23:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076775, 282340, 51918, '<td valign="top">This is an excelent photo; the contrast, the sense of motion, the expression on her face.  The only thing that would make it better, for me, is if there was a bit more detail on her cloths.  I can sees the belt buckle but everything else is lost in the darkness.</td>', 'This is an excelent photo; the contrast, the sense of motion, the expression on her face.  The only thing that would make it better, for me, is if there was a bit more detail on her cloths.  I can sees the belt buckle but everything else is lost in the darkness.', '2006-01-24 01:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076818, 282357, 46336, '<td valign="top">A different take on the subject. Shame it''s not in focus, and the yellow car is a bit blown. The colours also seem a bit flat.</td>', 'A different take on the subject. Shame it''s not in focus, and the yellow car is a bit blown. The colours also seem a bit flat.', '2006-01-24 02:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076822, 282972, 46336, '<td valign="top">Ouch. I find this over photoshopped. IMO it has ceased to be a photo and entered the realm of digital art, sadly not to my taste.</td>', 'Ouch. I find this over photoshopped. IMO it has ceased to be a photo and entered the realm of digital art, sadly not to my taste.', '2006-01-24 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076826, 283013, 46336, '<td valign="top">Nice stars. Personally I find the colours flat and the composition unattractive. Nothing draws me in or retains my attention.</td>', 'Nice stars. Personally I find the colours flat and the composition unattractive. Nothing draws me in or retains my attention.', '2006-01-24 02:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076827, 282570, 15475, '<td valign="top">beautiful! an 8!</td>', 'beautiful! an 8!', '2006-01-24 02:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
