(2076856, 280943, 46336, '<td valign="top">Brrr. looks cold. Shame it''s not really in focus. I don''t think you made as much of the environment as you could have - somehow I find the composition lacking. Perhaps if you had made more of the road (either cropping it or taking the shot more to the left) it would have worked.</td>', 'Brrr. looks cold. Shame it''s not really in focus. I don''t think you made as much of the environment as you could have - somehow I find the composition lacking. Perhaps if you had made more of the road (either cropping it or taking the shot more to the left) it would have worked.', '2006-01-24 02:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
