(2076867, 281286, 46336, '<td valign="top">coming back to my lower scores to comment, and I realise I was a bit harsh on my first sweep. I do like the arc of the trees calling me in. I think a bit of cropping on the right and bottom would have improved the composition.</td>', 'coming back to my lower scores to comment, and I realise I was a bit harsh on my first sweep. I do like the arc of the trees calling me in. I think a bit of cropping on the right and bottom would have improved the composition.', '2006-01-24 02:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
