(2076881, 279852, 46336, '<td valign="top">Not many folk about. Nice stars... I find the reflected light in the rear-view mirror very distracting.</td>', 'Not many folk about. Nice stars... I find the reflected light in the rear-view mirror very distracting.', '2006-01-24 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076882, 281786, 15475, '<td valign="top">my favorite!  awesome color, subject, perfect for this challenge.  it says it all, you don''t have to explain, yes "the slow road home!"</td>', 'my favorite!  awesome color, subject, perfect for this challenge.  it says it all, you don''t have to explain, yes "the slow road home!"', '2006-01-24 02:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076886, 282591, 46336, '<td valign="top">Indeed. The barrier is, I guess, your main subject. It really aught to be crisply in focus, but it isn''t. And there is no supporting act.</td>', 'Indeed. The barrier is, I guess, your main subject. It really aught to be crisply in focus, but it isn''t. And there is no supporting act.', '2006-01-24 02:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076888, 281130, 15475, '<td valign="top">a busy, narrow street... yep, this is in japan!</td>', 'a busy, narrow street... yep, this is in japan!', '2006-01-24 02:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076889, 282886, 46336, '<td valign="top">So soft and smooth, and lovely colours. It''s just too blurry for me.</td>', 'So soft and smooth, and lovely colours. It''s just too blurry for me.', '2006-01-24 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076891, 282932, 15475, '<td valign="top">i''m sure i''m not the only one with this comment... "why is this upside down?" - makes me feel a bit dizzy</td>', 'i''m sure i''m not the only one with this comment... "why is this upside down?" - makes me feel a bit dizzy', '2006-01-24 02:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076893, 282340, 15475, '<td valign="top">like a cover of a cd album</td>', 'like a cover of a cd album', '2006-01-24 02:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076902, 282970, 46336, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the foreground shallow depth of focus works here. With this composition I would have liked to have seen a large DOF, drawing me in.</td>', 'I don''t think the foreground shallow depth of focus works here. With this composition I would have liked to have seen a large DOF, drawing me in.', '2006-01-24 03:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076912, 281610, 46336, '<td valign="top">Fits the title. I can''t say I like the largely emprt foreground, especially to the right. Perhaps if you had cropped it down a bit...</td>', 'Fits the title. I can''t say I like the largely emprt foreground, especially to the right. Perhaps if you had cropped it down a bit...', '2006-01-24 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076918, 282976, 46336, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I like the foreground shallow depth of focus in this shot. to me it calls for a deeper DOF. the blow on the lights is also very distracting.</td>', 'I can''t say I like the foreground shallow depth of focus in this shot. to me it calls for a deeper DOF. the blow on the lights is also very distracting.', '2006-01-24 03:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076926, 282953, 46336, '<td valign="top">I find this shot very flat. The actual lights are very effectively rendered, but the rest just lack something.</td>', 'I find this shot very flat. The actual lights are very effectively rendered, but the rest just lack something.', '2006-01-24 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076931, 281445, 46336, '<td valign="top">Nothing appears to be in focus here. It could be a great shot, but for this.</td>', 'Nothing appears to be in focus here. It could be a great shot, but for this.', '2006-01-24 03:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076933, 280456, 46336, '<td valign="top">Not wise while driving...</td>', 'Not wise while driving...', '2006-01-24 03:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076946, 282777, 46336, '<td valign="top">Only four points to your stars, ...interesting.</td>', 'Only four points to your stars, ...interesting.', '2006-01-24 03:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2076954, 280028, 46336, '<td valign="top">retracted<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 04:52:29.</i></td>', 'retracted', '2006-01-24 03:22:53.000000', '2006-02-08 04:52:29.000000', 1),
(2077015, 282451, 47020, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and exposure.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I find the composition distracting -- specifically that the rails are off-center (frequently a good thing, but when you have parallel lines like that, it''s nice (to me, anyway) to have them come from the corners of the image...  I also wonder if maybe your horizon is off -- the front-most tie seems to be OK, but the overall image feels to me like it''s tilted to the left...  not certain.<br/> <br/>Still a nice image.  I give it a high 7.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and exposure. Unfortunately, I find the composition distracting -- specifically that the rails are off-center (frequently a good thing, but when you have parallel lines like that, it''s nice (to me, anyway) to have them come from the corners of the image...  I also wonder if maybe your horizon is off -- the front-most tie seems to be OK, but the overall image feels to me like it''s tilted to the left...  not certain. Still a nice image.  I give it a high 7.', '2006-01-24 04:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2077029, 282685, 45354, '<td valign="top">Love the composition</td>', 'Love the composition', '2006-01-24 04:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2077039, 281594, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is quite amazing, and I love the position from which you have taken this image, as it works so well.....A really great image, very well done.....</td>', 'This is quite amazing, and I love the position from which you have taken this image, as it works so well.....A really great image, very well done.....', '2006-01-24 05:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
