(2077046, 282141, 48228, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections and everything about this fine image.....I think it also has the "WOW'' factor as wel.....</td>', 'Love the reflections and everything about this fine image.....I think it also has the "WOW'' factor as wel.....', '2006-01-24 05:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
