(2080506, 280555, 48228, '<td valign="top">Hi Judi, I am just so blessed, and blown away by this infrared image, it definately has the "WOW" factor, and now added to my favorites. <br/> <br/>I see you are from Queensland as well, so I am so pleased about that, being a Queenslander myself. <br/> <br/>Wonderful, wonderful, wonderful image, and all I can say is "CONGRATULATIONS".....for your first ribbon, a BLUE......</td>', 'Hi Judi, I am just so blessed, and blown away by this infrared image, it definately has the "WOW" factor, and now added to my favorites.  I see you are from Queensland as well, so I am so pleased about that, being a Queenslander myself.  Wonderful, wonderful, wonderful image, and all I can say is "CONGRATULATIONS".....for your first ribbon, a BLUE......', '2006-01-25 01:21:09.000000', NULL, 0),
