(2081404, 280028, 42171, '<td valign="top">A fabulous scene, though the colours look too fake... Also, some blur/OOF in the lower left corner.<br/> <br/>I''m surprised it made blue, but well done!</td>', 'A fabulous scene, though the colours look too fake... Also, some blur/OOF in the lower left corner. I''m surprised it made blue, but well done!', '2006-01-25 04:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2081514, 281936, 30861, '<td valign="top">For the record, the car was accidental. This is a dead-end road from out of the marshlands, and what some dude was doing driving out in the pre-dawn I have no clue. I was shooting this in the natural light entirely, so I counted this as a wasted frame and popped another one off after he was gone. When I processed these later, the "natural" shot was totally blah, and this one was at least "interesting", so in retrospect I should have turned MY jeep around and lit the damned road myself, but that didn''t occur to me at the time, and this was shot the morning-of the challenge, so...<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'For the record, the car was accidental. This is a dead-end road from out of the marshlands, and what some dude was doing driving out in the pre-dawn I have no clue. I was shooting this in the natural light entirely, so I counted this as a wasted frame and popped another one off after he was gone. When I processed these later, the "natural" shot was totally blah, and this one was at least "interesting", so in retrospect I should have turned MY jeep around and lit the damned road myself, but that didn''t occur to me at the time, and this was shot the morning-of the challenge, so... R.', '2006-01-25 05:43:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2081558, 282340, 4281, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why this picture got disqualified. As far as I can tell there was no spot editing although Larus did use the vignetting tool in the Adobe Camera RAW converter. I feel it extremely difficult to understand how that can be called ''spot editing'' and for that matter I''ve used it in a basic challenge myself - //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=271074<br/> <br/>I hope this judgement will be reconsidered, at least if the vignetting was the sole reason for the disqualification.</td>', 'I don''t understand why this picture got disqualified. As far as I can tell there was no spot editing although Larus did use the vignetting tool in the Adobe Camera RAW converter. I feel it extremely difficult to understand how that can be called ''spot editing'' and for that matter I''ve used it in a basic challenge myself - //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=271074 I hope this judgement will be reconsidered, at least if the vignetting was the sole reason for the disqualification.', '2006-01-25 06:06:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2081563, 280028, 24778, '<td valign="top">indeed I exagerated the colours, but is was on purpose. remember those colorfull, ireal jigsaw puzzle games? I wanted to simulate one of their immages :)</td>', 'indeed I exagerated the colours, but is was on purpose. remember those colorfull, ireal jigsaw puzzle games? I wanted to simulate one of their immages :)', '2006-01-25 06:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
