(2081614, 280433, 49388, '<td valign="top">Average Vote per Commenters:6.429<br/>Average Vote per Users w/ Cameras: 4.083<br/>Average Vote per Users w/out Cameras: 3.667<br/> <br/>Suppose there just isnt flashy thingies to catch beings without The Great Eye.<br/>Beings with The Great Eye watched tad more of this picture and commenters even thought about it. I myself didnt acquire any deeper insight.</td>', 'Average Vote per Commenters:6.429Average Vote per Users w/ Cameras: 4.083Average Vote per Users w/out Cameras: 3.667 Suppose there just isnt flashy thingies to catch beings without The Great Eye.Beings with The Great Eye watched tad more of this picture and commenters even thought about it. I myself didnt acquire any deeper insight.', '2006-01-25 06:54:15.000000', NULL, 0),
