(2081669, 280028, 30982, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alithenake:</b></div><hr/><i> Thank you all for all you kind and encouraging words. I made it once again ... this one is for my brother .. keep it going bro !!!<br/> <br/>The location is Transfagarasanu road, highest road in ROmania .. So take your bikes and come visit :) .. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If I ever make it to Romania, I''m definitely bringing the bike - thanks for sharing this lovely view with us!</td>', 'Originally posted by alithenake: Thank you all for all you kind and encouraging words. I made it once again ... this one is for my brother .. keep it going bro !!! The location is Transfagarasanu road, highest road in ROmania .. So take your bikes and come visit :) ..   If I ever make it to Romania, I''m definitely bringing the bike - thanks for sharing this lovely view with us!', '2006-01-25 07:26:04.000000', NULL, 0),
