(2082361, 280927, 10413, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a chance to vote on this one but did look at the thumbnails and this one caught my attention. I love the colors and the perpective is great. Congratulations on your first ribbon.</td>', 'I didn''t get a chance to vote on this one but did look at the thumbnails and this one caught my attention. I love the colors and the perpective is great. Congratulations on your first ribbon.', '2006-01-25 11:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2082376, 280292, 43434, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>This is why I did not enter road ... what a wonderful shot, nicely balanced colours, looks great in both thumbnail and full size.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Well done, the composition is lovely.  Take note of what the voters have said ... although they do contradict each other which does not help lots.  I think that taking into account that the picture could have done without the skyline, but keep everything else may have helped in progressing it further.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Meets the challenge well. I just love the yellow line.  I can understand you wishing to lighten the barn and windmill ... but they still worked well for this level of challenge.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Well lit, but natural lighting is a good thing.  I think that the contrast was worked well for this entry.  I can''t see the dust spots maybe I am not looking hard enough.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>Think about the cropping.  Apart from that I am not sure, I think it is great ... <br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Fantastic shot... if only we had places like that here :)<br/> <br/>If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', '::: Critique Club :::  Hi, my name is Kari and from the critique club. First Impression - the most important one: This is why I did not enter road ... what a wonderful shot, nicely balanced colours, looks great in both thumbnail and full size. Composition: Well done, the composition is lovely.  Take note of what the voters have said ... although they do contradict each other which does not help lots.  I think that taking into account that the picture could have done without the skyline, but keep everything else may have helped in progressing it further. Subject: Meets the challenge well. I just love the yellow line.  I can understand you wishing to lighten the barn and windmill ... but they still worked well for this level of challenge. Technical (Colour and light): Well lit, but natural lighting is a good thing.  I think that the contrast was worked well for this entry.  I can''t see the dust spots maybe I am not looking hard enough. To grow its vote?: Think about the cropping.  Apart from that I am not sure, I think it is great ...  Summary: Fantastic shot... if only we had places like that here :) If you''ve got any questions about this critique, please feel free to contact me via the PM system. Cheers Kari', '2006-01-25 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 0),
