(2083781, 282928, 49480, '<td valign="top">To answer the comments that this had...I actually made it grainy on purpose.  Also, since my focus was the track (the bright portion in front of the runners) I was less concerned with their focus since when I was taking the picture I was trying to capture the transient nature of the runners on a constant road.  In any case, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'To answer the comments that this had...I actually made it grainy on purpose.  Also, since my focus was the track (the bright portion in front of the runners) I was less concerned with their focus since when I was taking the picture I was trying to capture the transient nature of the runners on a constant road.  In any case, thanks for the comments.', '2006-01-25 16:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
