(2083934, 282340, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am also really disappointed that this got dq''d!  As I stated during the challenge, this was my strong pick for blue.   And I didn''t think anything you did in RAW before you even opened the picture counted against the basic editing rules.   Eeeeeeee. . ..now I know.   Sorry you had to be the sacrificial lamb that taught us all <i>that</i> rule.<br/> <br/>But everyone''s right.  It doesn''t take away from how awesome the photo is. . .only that there''s a pink highlight marking it instead of a yellow ribon  :(</td>', 'I am also really disappointed that this got dq''d!  As I stated during the challenge, this was my strong pick for blue.   And I didn''t think anything you did in RAW before you even opened the picture counted against the basic editing rules.   Eeeeeeee. . ..now I know.   Sorry you had to be the sacrificial lamb that taught us all that rule. But everyone''s right.  It doesn''t take away from how awesome the photo is. . .only that there''s a pink highlight marking it instead of a yellow ribon  :(', '2006-01-25 17:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
