(2119911, 282141, 31889, '<td valign="top">Just saw this for the first time.<br/> <br/>Great shot Sam and congrats on the top 15 finish.</td>', 'Just saw this for the first time. Great shot Sam and congrats on the top 15 finish.', '2006-02-03 20:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2127355, 281581, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4.  I liked the perspective - not too fond of the choice of subject to ''focus on'' - but your call on that.  Difficult to adjust the crop and lose the diminishing ''horizon'' of the road - but if that top right corner where the grass seems to end could have been cropped out, might have made this better in my opinion.  Looks like it (the focal point) needs to be a fraction sharper too.</td>', 'I gave this a 4.  I liked the perspective - not too fond of the choice of subject to ''focus on'' - but your call on that.  Difficult to adjust the crop and lose the diminishing ''horizon'' of the road - but if that top right corner where the grass seems to end could have been cropped out, might have made this better in my opinion.  Looks like it (the focal point) needs to be a fraction sharper too.', '2006-02-06 16:12:04.000000', NULL, 0),
