(2136889, 280620, 42456, '<td valign="top">I would have like to seen this even sharper. The angled lines are good as they give the image a foreboding feel. I would have also cropped out as much of the dark foreground shadow of the tree as possible. IMO. I agree with the commentor on range of values in the image; however, it appears abit flat...maybe more contrast or a sepia filter. All in all...a very nice image...a 6.014 indicates to me that you''re in the hunt and doing things right...keep up the good work!</td>', 'I would have like to seen this even sharper. The angled lines are good as they give the image a foreboding feel. I would have also cropped out as much of the dark foreground shadow of the tree as possible. IMO. I agree with the commentor on range of values in the image; however, it appears abit flat...maybe more contrast or a sepia filter. All in all...a very nice image...a 6.014 indicates to me that you''re in the hunt and doing things right...keep up the good work!', '2006-02-09 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
