(2148693, 282879, 32133, '<td valign="top">I was a Lucent/Bell Labs person as well.  I must have subconsciously understood the reference to twilight as well.  It was good while it lasted!</td>', 'I was a Lucent/Bell Labs person as well.  I must have subconsciously understood the reference to twilight as well.  It was good while it lasted!', '2006-02-13 22:00:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152764, 282984, 12611, '<td valign="top">In theory, this is nice; however, it really doesn''t work well with this crop/composition. The focus is all on the area of sweatshirt hood; which dominates the frame; the true focus should be on the paths behind, and they should at least be intentionally obscured, and not randomly darkened or lightened. perhaps a crop along shoulder level, or a little less contrast would work here.</td>', 'In theory, this is nice; however, it really doesn''t work well with this crop/composition. The focus is all on the area of sweatshirt hood; which dominates the frame; the true focus should be on the paths behind, and they should at least be intentionally obscured, and not randomly darkened or lightened. perhaps a crop along shoulder level, or a little less contrast would work here.', '2006-02-15 08:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
