(2394927, 282984, 50466, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but would be significantly better if the two roads were in focus and the person was out of focus. It would also help if you burned the edges of the left path, and maybe waited for some clouds to come along to make the sky more dramtic. Another idea that might also make this more interesting is if you applied a slight radial blur that zoomed in towards the person. Just a few ideas.<br/> <br/>Charles</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but would be significantly better if the two roads were in focus and the person was out of focus. It would also help if you burned the edges of the left path, and maybe waited for some clouds to come along to make the sky more dramtic. Another idea that might also make this more interesting is if you applied a slight radial blur that zoomed in towards the person. Just a few ideas. Charles', '2006-05-08 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 0),
