(2694671, 280620, 48228, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of your portfolio and so pleased I visited it today. You are very talanted and love so many of your images, expecially this one. i think it could be my favorite, but I also like the two other ones I commented on as well. Keep up the great work andlook forward to seeing a lot more of your images.....<br/>This was my comment re the challenge, but just have to add some more..... <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> This is pleasing to the eye, well done..... I love the avenue of trees..... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I am in awe of your portfolio and so pleased I visited it today. You are very talanted and love so many of your images, expecially this one. i think it could be my favorite, but I also like the two other ones I commented on as well. Keep up the great work andlook forward to seeing a lot more of your images.....This was my comment re the challenge, but just have to add some more..... Originally posted by sherpet: This is pleasing to the eye, well done..... I love the avenue of trees.....   ', '2006-08-04 08:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
